  {
   "step": "做法第 1、2 步",
   "fact": "bindMenu 的菜单选项（ContextMenuOptions）没写 placement 时取 Placement.BottomLeft",
   "source": "鸿蒙 SDK 的 ets/component/common.d.ts，ContextMenuOptions.placement",
   "kind": "鸿蒙接口",
   "origin": "沿用并复核"
  },
  {
   "step": "做法第 1、2 步",
   "fact": "ContextMenuOptions.mask（API 20 起）没写时：有预览时为 true，否则为 false，即普通 bindMenu 菜单默认不带遮罩",
   "source": "鸿蒙 SDK 的 ets/component/common.d.ts，ContextMenuOptions.mask",
   "kind": "鸿蒙接口",
   "origin": "沿用并复核"
  },
  {
   "step": "做法第 1、3 步",
   "fact": "MenuItemOptions.builder 用于创建子菜单；Menu 的 subMenuExpandingMode 没写时为 SIDE_EXPAND（子菜单在同一平面侧边展开），EMBEDDED_EXPAND 嵌在主菜单内展开，STACK_EXPAND 浮在主菜单上方展开（API 12 起）",
   "source": "鸿蒙 SDK 的 ets/component/menu_item.d.ts，MenuItemOptions.builder；https://gitcode.com/openharmony/docs/blob/master/zh-cn/application-dev/reference/apis-arkui/arkui-ts/ts-basic-components-menu.md，subMenuExpandingMode；https://gitcode.com/openharmony/docs/blob/master/zh-cn/application-dev/reference/apis-arkui/arkui-ts/ts-basic-components-menu.md，SubMenuExpandingMode",
   "kind": "鸿蒙接口",
   "origin": "沿用并复核"
  },
  {
   "step": "做法第 4 步",
   "fact": "bindMenu 以自定义 builder 作菜单内容时，轻点菜单里的自定义内容会关闭菜单",
   "source": "卡里上机实测（case-45230e39613edd881823，设备上轻点子菜单入口）",
   "kind": "卡里验证",
   "origin": "沿用并复核"
